== direct-ok-no-group
   tls validate=2 ca=None
   server ldaps://dc.example.org:636 use_ssl=True tls=FakeTls connect_timeout=5
   bind alice@example.org auth=SIMPLE auto_bind=True receive_timeout=10
   search DC=example,DC=org (sAMAccountName=alice) memberOf,displayName,sAMAccountName,mail,distinguishedName
   unbind alice@example.org
   -> (True, {'username': 'alice', 'display_name': 'Alice A', 'email': 'alice@example.org', 'upn': 'alice@example.org'})
