== filter-escaped
   tls validate=2 ca=None
   server ldaps://dc.example.org:636 use_ssl=True tls=FakeTls connect_timeout=5
   bind a*(b)@example.org auth=SIMPLE auto_bind=True receive_timeout=10
   search DC=example,DC=org (sAMAccountName=a\2a\28b\29) memberOf,displayName,sAMAccountName,mail,distinguishedName
   unbind a*(b)@example.org
   -> (True, {'username': 'a*(b)', 'display_name': 'Odd', 'email': '', 'upn': 'a*(b)@example.org'})
